<title>USA: DVI foresees higher Q2 earnings.</title>
<headline>DVI foresees higher Q2 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>DOYLESTOWN, Pa 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DVI Inc said Monday it expected net income for its second quarter ended December 31 to be about nine percent higher than the amount earned in the first quarter.</p>
<p>The company, which is to report earnings by February 6, had a net per share of $0.18 in the first quarter against $0.20 for the same period last year.</p>
<p>DVI is an independent specialty finance company that conducts a medical equipment finance business and a related medical receivables finance business.</p>
</text>
